    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unknown Rules</strong>\u00a0is an independently developed first-person horror puzzle game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bFrontroom (Pre-Backroom) Introduction\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region has its &quot;chosen unlucky ones&quot;\u2014ordinary people who, through sheer coincidence, fall into the Backroom. Before their descent, however, they were simply diligent workers in their respective Frontrooms. You can choose to work alone or team up with friends to complete your tasks. Perhaps, during your routine, an unexpected journey awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*****************************************************************************<br><i>Note: Only one Frontroom level can be selected. All Frontroom levels lead to Backroom Level 0.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bLevel 1: Office\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>You are an ordinary office worker. On this day, the office is eerily empty. After working overtime, you decide to rest your head on the desk for a nap. When you awaken, the environment has shifted into something unrecognizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909140/extras/2a320cba9328fe06c509603bcd2b9d86.avif?t=1745653314\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bLevel 2: Logistics Warehouse\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>You are a night-shift warehouse packer. As usual, you retrieve, package, and ship orders. But upon completing your quota, you discover an unsettling note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bBackroom Introduction\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bCongratulations\u2014you\u2019ve been chosen. Due to the scale of certain levels, please review the level descriptions before proceeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*****************************************************************************<br>\u200b<strong>\u200bCurrently Developed Backroom Levels\u200b</strong>\u200b<br><i>(Descriptive reference order only; not actual gameplay sequence)</i><br><i>Note: Backroom levels are unlocked progressively and cannot be freely selected.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u200b<strong>\u200bLevel 0: The Darkroom\u200b</strong></i>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated terrain using PCG technology. Requires real-time lighting (RTX 2060 or higher recommended). A fixed-map version for lower-end GPUs will be added later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909140/extras/f760a08068d0cf374f50e9806e067872.avif?t=1745653314\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u200b<strong>\u200bLevel 37: Sublimity\u200b</strong></i>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A serene &quot;poolcore&quot; environment optimized for multiplayer fun. Currently uses Lumen soft ray tracing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909140/extras/1d4613b7fe27ab2c08030d425c07fd0f.avif?t=1745653314\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u200b<strong>\u200bLevel 9: Suburbs\u200b</strong></i>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A windswept, sinister suburban nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909140/extras/02dde996bbe98575933ebdea4a8b2708.avif?t=1745653314\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u200b<strong>\u200bLevel 1: Abandoned Public Zone\u200b</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909140/extras/76e29eb8b8fa0b9fd93ab439920675b5.avif?t=1745653314\" width=616 height=300 /></span>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u200b<strong>\u200bLevel 6: Lights Off\u200b</strong></i>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Technical note:</i> Current scanning relies on ray tracing (RTX 2060+ required). A low-end GPU alternative will use basic particle scanning (less precise, ignores moving objects, no object data\u2014scenery only).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909140/extras/e52f49e1c4e6c69ffa006ab7cc524de2.avif?t=1745653314\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some \u200b\u200bKey Items\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, manage and use every item you find. Your inventory includes \u200b<strong>\u200b8 backpack slots\u200b</strong>\u200b and \u200b<strong>\u200b2 pocket slots\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bEnergy Drink\u200b</strong>\u200b: Temporarily boosts stamina.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bSanity Pills\u200b</strong>\u200b: Stabilizes your mental state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bBatteries\u200b</strong>\u200b: Restores power to electronic devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bMysterious Notes\u200b</strong>\u200b: Provide clues to solve puzzles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bCore Mechanics\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bStamina\u200b</strong>\u200b: Limited endurance\u2014critical during escapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bSanity\u200b</strong>\u200b: Fear gnaws at your mind when encountering the supernatural.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bHealth\u200b</strong>\u200b: Survivable injuries unless facing overwhelmingly powerful entities.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bParty Mode\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boredom is inevitable, so I\u2019m developing open-ended features to keep players engaged. Two experimental party maps are now available:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bLevel 1: Go Parlor\u200b</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Go enthusiasts: Challenge a friend to a match while listening to music. <i>Note:</i> This mode is unpolished due to limited development time, but it supports full Go matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909140/extras/1bba5f654be4471910d9d832d5ed2bad.avif?t=1745653314\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bLevel 2: Cinema\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Input a video URL (.MP4, .m3u8, or untested rtmp/rtsp streams) to watch together. Basic playback is functional, though features are incomplete. Contact the developer for issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909140/extras/77977ea7094ec4a361b8b61800200a86.avif?t=1745653314\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bIn Development\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bNew Backroom Level\u200b</strong>\u200b: Level 94 &quot;Animation&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bNew Frontroom Level\u200b</strong>\u200b: Amusement Park</p></li></ul>",
